+# Hourly rentals
+
+Request: let customers rent by the hour. `addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice` (euro cents per
+hour). A rental shorter than a day that starts and ends on the hour is priced at `hourlyPrice` for each
+hour, with no long-stay discount. An item without an hourly price cannot be rented by the hour (quote and
+book throw). Rentals of a day or more still start and end at midnight UTC and use the daily price.
+Implemented in `price()` in `src/index.ts`; covered by tests in `test/rental.test.ts`.
